= Introduction

The goal of this document is to have the most common used elements for the markup language `typst` readily available.
A detailed documentation can be found on theirs website: #link("https://typst.app/docs")[https://typst.app/docs]
It is to note that these are *my* most common used elements. For some elements custom templates are needed:
- #link("https://github.com/PgBiel/typst-tablex/")[tablex]
- #link("https://github.com/typst/typst/issues/1276")[myref]
- all files in the `00-templates/` folder such as
  - `boxes.typ`
  - `constants.typ`
  - `helpers.typ`
  - `items.typ`
  - `metadata.typ`
  - `template-*`
